.TH RATASH-STATUS 1 2026-08-01 "Ratash 0.1.1" "Ratash User Commands"
.SH NAME
ratash\-status \- Open the Status Interface or print one JSON status snapshot
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBratash status\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Open the Status Interface or print one JSON status snapshot
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Emit a versioned JSON document or NDJSON stream
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
